title: AbriLanternTale
---
Keeper: Venn wants a route that waits for us. My grandmother would have laughed at that. #emotion:Amused
Sela: Laughed? #emotion:Curious
Keeper: Tallow used to trade with a canyon town called Lanternwick. Their lanterns read the passages and guided ships along them. #emotion:Tender
Taren: Even passages that move? #emotion:Curious
Keeper: That was the whole trick. They stopped answering last season, but their course is still in our beacon, out through the Wick Reach. #emotion:Worried
Sela: A route that waits. That's Venn's third condition. #emotion:Determined
Taren: And the food? #emotion:Neutral
Sela: One impossible thing at a time, Vosk. #emotion:Playful
<<setFlag lantern.routeKnown>>
<<startQuest LanternRoad>>
===
title: AbriLanternRepeat
---
Keeper: The Wick Reach warp is off the approach, starboard of the dock. Bring me back a lantern story with a happy ending. #emotion:Tender
===
title: AbriLanternHome
---
Keeper: Aumi's apprentice is already over there, fussing with my lamps. Grandmother would call that a happy ending. #emotion:Happy
Sela: The chart answers every relay that's still lit. Tallow can follow its passage now. #emotion:Determined
Keeper: A route that waits. Venn will hate how pretty it is. #emotion:Amused
Taren: One of her three. Food and power are still on the list. #emotion:Worried
Sela: Pell says the river towns on Xylos move their farms with the floods. #emotion:Curious
Taren: Food first. Xylos it is. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag chapter2.homecoming>>
===
title: SelaWickRelays
---
Sela: Those towers are relays. Old ones. And every one of them has been cut open. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Cut for what? #emotion:Curious
Sela: The glass in the crown. Somebody wants it badly enough to strip a whole chain. #emotion:Intense
Taren: This one still has its glass. Light it before those skiffs come back for it. #emotion:Determined
===
title: AumiFirst
---
Aumi: That's close enough. The last crew that docked here left with three of my relays in their hold. #emotion:Angry
Taren: We're from Tallow Drift. We came for help, not glass. #emotion:Neutral
Aumi: Everyone comes for help. Then they come back for the glass. #emotion:Worried
Sela: Tallow is moving with its passage. Your relays used to guide stations like that. We need a route that waits. #emotion:Determined
Aumi: Used to. The gorge relays are dark, and Muster scavengers are working in the dark beside them. #emotion:Intense
Aumi: Relight the three gorge relays and drive the scavengers out. Then I'll believe you came to give something back. #emotion:Determined
Taren: Where's the way down? #emotion:Curious
Aumi: Orchard gate, west terrace. Grazers hate light, and so do the Muster. Use that. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: AumiRepeat
---
Aumi: The orchard gate's past the last trees. I want the relays lit and the cutting stopped. I'll see the light from the stair. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: AumiReturn
---
Aumi: The gorge is lit. I could see it from the stair. #emotion:Shocked
Taren: Their captain's sitting in your relay with her hands empty. Send your keepers down. #emotion:Neutral
Aumi: I said I'd believe you once the gorge was lit. I believe you. #emotion:Tender
Aumi: Ishen copied this off the archive wall while you were below. Look at it before you tell me what it's worth. #emotion:Determined
Sela: These light patterns are my chart. The same bends, moving. And there are towns travelling beside them. #emotion:Shocked
Aumi: When the roads last left, most of our ancestors went with them. The rest kept the lanterns lit for anyone who came back. #emotion:Tender
Aumi: Keep the chart. Every relay that still burns will answer it. A route that waits, as you put it. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag lanternwick.chartGiven>>
Aumi: And take Pell, my apprentice. She'll keep your lantern lit, and tell you all about Xylos whether you ask or not. #emotion:Amused
===
title: AumiFinal
---
Aumi: Go on. The relays know you now. Come back with a story worth adding to the wall. #emotion:Tender
===
title: PellFirst
---
Pell: You flew in? Actually flew? Not in a ship, as the ship? #emotion:Shocked
Sela: As the ship. Mind the vanes. #emotion:Playful
Pell: I'm Pell! I do the lower stair lamps, forty climbs a day. If you ever need to know anything about stairs, ask me. #emotion:Happy
Pell: Don't let Aumi scare you off. She's only like that with people. #emotion:Amused
===
title: PellRepeat
---
Pell: If you see a lamp out on the stair, tell me. If you see a grazer, don't tell me. Just run. #emotion:Playful
===
title: PellLampOffer
---
Pell: Before you go anywhere, can I ask you something? Quietly? #emotion:Worried
Pell: I dropped my lamp down in the gorge. Not dropped. A grazer took it, and I ran, and the lamp didn't. #emotion:Flustered
Pell: It was my mother's. Aumi doesn't know it's gone. There's a den under the fallen tower, past the first relay. #emotion:Worried
Taren: We'll look for it. #emotion:Tender
<<startQuest PellsLamp>>
===
title: PellLampReturn
---
Taren: One lamp. Slightly chewed. #emotion:Amused
Pell: You found it! It still lights. Look at that, it still lights. #emotion:Happy
Pell: Take these cells, they were for the lamp. And don't tell Aumi. Actually, do. Tell her I'm the one who sent you. #emotion:Playful
<<setFlag pell.lampReturned>>
===
title: PellPost
---
Pell: Aumi says I'm going with you. To Tallow. On a station that moves. #emotion:Shocked
Pell: I've packed four times. Nobody can tell me what you pack for a station that moves, so it's mostly lamps. #emotion:Happy
===
title: IshenFirst
---
Ishen: Visitors, and not the kind with cutting torches. Come in. Mind the record. #emotion:Happy
Ishen: I'm Ishen, archivist. I read walls for a living, and I'd like it noted that these are excellent walls. #emotion:Amused
Taren: What's on the walls? #emotion:Curious
Ishen: Passages. Four thousand and twelve of them, by lantern, and every one dark since the Muster started cutting the relays that feed them. #emotion:Sad
Ishen: Three record plates never came up from the Sunken Relay below the gorge, and I've never read them. They rest on the old mirror stands, each with a light on it. Bring back what you find. #emotion:Determined
<<startQuest IshensRecord>>
===
title: IshenRepeat
---
Ishen: Three plates, wide as serving dishes and cut with circles, each resting on an old mirror stand with a light on it. If a stand is lit, it's holding something of mine. #emotion:Amused
===
title: IshenRecordReturn
---
Ishen: All three. You have no idea what you're holding. Well, neither do I yet. Give me a moment. #emotion:Shocked
Ishen: These came from Oriel, a world that tried to hold a passage still the last time the roads left. #emotion:Worried
Ishen: The record says the passage fought the cage. It says the world broke around it. #emotion:Sad
Sela: The Muster were stripping relay glass down there. Do they know about this? #emotion:Worried
Ishen: I hope not. I'll keep these where nobody with a torch can find them. Take this emitter. It was a lens once, and it's wasted on walls. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag ishen.recordRestored>>
===
title: IshenPost
---
Ishen: The Great Lantern's lit again. I've read the Oriel plates eleven times, and they don't improve. Tell me if you see anything worth writing down. #emotion:Amused
===
title: CorraFirst
---
Corra: Fresh faces, fresh scrip. Corra Vey, arch market. I sell gel, parts and advice, and the advice is free. #emotion:Happy
Corra: Here's some: don't argue with Aumi before breakfast. #emotion:Amused
-> Show us what you have.
    <<shop>>
-> Maybe later.
    Corra: Later's fine. Later still pays. #emotion:Smug
===
title: CorraRepeat
---
Corra: Gel, cells, parts. What do you need? #emotion:Happy
<<shop>>
===
title: CorraPost
---
Corra: Brekk ate. Then he fixed my awning without asking. I might keep him. #emotion:Amused
<<shop>>
===
title: CorraRationsOffer
---
Corra: There's a scavengers' camp in the gorge, by the second relay. You've seen it, or you will. #emotion:Worried
Taren: What about it? #emotion:Neutral
Corra: They keep ration crates by the fire. Muster rations. Ugly, but they keep. #emotion:Neutral
Corra: Bring one to the orchard shed. Someone out there can't eat our food, and he's too proud to steal theirs. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Someone? #emotion:Curious
Corra: Walk up slowly. Don't stare. #emotion:Determined
<<startQuest UnswornRations>>
<<shop>>
===
title: BrekkFirst
---
Brekk: You're not Muster. Good. Then you didn't see me. #emotion:Worried
Taren: We're not looking for anyone. #emotion:Neutral
Brekk: People who aren't looking don't come up that canyon. Keep walking. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: BrekkRepeat
---
Brekk: Still here. Still not seen. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: BrekkRations
---
Taren: From Corra, by way of the scavengers' camp. #emotion:Neutral
Brekk: Muster rations. I swore I'd never eat these again. #emotion:Sad
Brekk: I was a smith at the Bridle works. I made cages for a living until I couldn't stand it. Then I walked. #emotion:Sad
Sela: Cages for what? #emotion:Curious
Brekk: For roads. The creatures you fly through. We made the leashes, and whoever holds one owns every world past it. #emotion:Sad
Brekk: Thank Corra for me. The ones who walk out call themselves Unsworn. If you meet the rest, tell them some of us stopped. This edge was the last good thing I made there. Take it. #emotion:Tender
<<setFlag met.Brekk>>
<<setFlag unsworn.rationsDelivered>>
===
title: BrekkPost
---
Brekk: Corra has me fixing awnings. First honest metal I've touched in years. #emotion:Tender
===
title: SelaRelayLit
---
Sela: Hold it steady. The charge is catching. If the glass remembers its pattern, it'll light on its own. #emotion:Curious
Taren: Any grazer near this thing is about to have a bad evening. #emotion:Amused
Sela: Grazers hate light. Aumi did say to use that. #emotion:Playful
===
title: SelaSunkenRelay
---
Taren: This was a relay station. A whole station, under the canyon. #emotion:Curious
Sela: Fresh cuts on the lantern housings. They're still down here, Vosk. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Good. Saves us looking. #emotion:Determined
===
title: HessaConfront
---
Hessa: Shapers. Out here. Somebody's paying you better than they pay me. #emotion:Smug
Taren: Nobody's paying us. Put the glass down. #emotion:Determined
Hessa: When the roads go, every world left behind will need someone to answer to. The Muster intends to be that someone. #emotion:Intense
Hessa: This glass helps. Your lantern-keeper's feelings don't. #emotion:Smug
Sela: So that's a no. #emotion:Playful
Hessa: That's a no. #emotion:Angry
<<setFlag relay.hessaConfronted>>
===
title: HessaYields
---
Hessa: Enough. Enough! You've made your point, Shapers. #emotion:Angry
Taren: Hands where I can see them. Aumi's keepers can walk you out. #emotion:Determined
Hessa: You think one canyon matters? The Warmaster has a hundred crews like mine, and none of them lose sleep over lanterns. #emotion:Smug
Sela: They can lose it over us instead. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag relay.hessaYielded>>
===
title: HessaRepeat
---
Hessa: I'm waiting on your keepers. Go and gloat somewhere with better light. #emotion:Smug
===
title: HessaYieldsLate
---
Hessa: Took you long enough. The whole canyon's lit up, and I've been sitting here with my hands empty. #emotion:Smug
Taren: Stay that way. Aumi's keepers are on their way down. #emotion:Determined
Hessa: You think one canyon matters? The Warmaster has a hundred crews like mine, and none of them lose sleep over lanterns. #emotion:Smug
Sela: They can lose it over us instead. #emotion:Determined
<<setFlag relay.hessaYielded>>
===
title: HessaGuarded
---
Hessa: Your keepers don't talk and they won't let me sit. Go and gloat somewhere with better light. #emotion:Smug
===
title: AbriLanternWaiting
---
Keeper: I did the cabins while you were out. Half of them want to turn back, and the rest want a window seat. I tell them you'll be back with the end of the story. #emotion:Tender
===
title: AbriLanternAfter
---
Keeper: Xylos won't come to us, and nobody's charted the way there yet. Meanwhile the cabins have started asking about dinner. #emotion:Amused
===
title: PellLampAfter
---
Pell: It's on the stair, where she kept it. Aumi walked past it twice and said nothing, which from Aumi is a parade. #emotion:Happy
===
title: PellTallow
---
Pell: Nobody told me stations hum. I've relit your corridor lamp twice. It wasn't out. #emotion:Happy
===
